{"number":86,"name":"سُورَةُ الطَّارِقِ","englishName":"At-Taariq","englishNameTranslation":"The Morning Star","numberOfAyahs":17,"items":[{"id":"q:86:1","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":1,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ","en":"By the sky and the night comer -","bn":"শপথ আকাশের এবং রাত্রিতে আগমনকারীর।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/1"},{"id":"q:86:2","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":2,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the night comer?","bn":"আপনি জানেন, যে রাত্রিতে আসে সেটা কি?","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/2"},{"id":"q:86:3","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":3,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ","en":"It is the piercing star -","bn":"সেটা এক উজ্জ্বল নক্ষত্র।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/3"},{"id":"q:86:4","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":4,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍۢ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌۭ","en":"There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.","bn":"প্রত্যেকের উপর একজন তত্ত্বাবধায়ক রয়েছে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/4"},{"id":"q:86:5","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":5,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ","en":"So let man observe from what he was created.","bn":"অতএব, মানুষের দেখা উচিত কি বস্তু থেকে সে সৃজিত হয়েছে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/5"},{"id":"q:86:6","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":6,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍۢ دَافِقٍۢ","en":"He was created from a fluid, ejected,","bn":"সে সৃজিত হয়েছে সবেগে স্খলিত পানি থেকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/6"},{"id":"q:86:7","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":7,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ","en":"Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.","bn":"এটা নির্গত হয় মেরুদন্ড ও বক্ষপাজরের মধ্য থেকে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/7"},{"id":"q:86:8","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":8,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌۭ","en":"Indeed, Allah, to return him [to life], is Able.","bn":"নিশ্চয় তিনি তাকে ফিরিয়ে নিতে সক্ষম।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/8"},{"id":"q:86:9","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":9,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ","en":"The Day when secrets will be put on trial,","bn":"যেদিন গোপন বিষয়াদি পরীক্ষিত হবে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/9"},{"id":"q:86:10","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":10,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍۢ وَلَا نَاصِرٍۢ","en":"Then man will have no power or any helper.","bn":"সেদিন তার কোন শক্তি থাকবে না এবং সাহায্যকারীও থাকবে না।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/10"},{"id":"q:86:11","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":11,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ","en":"By the sky which returns [rain]","bn":"শপথ চক্রশীল আকাশের","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/11"},{"id":"q:86:12","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":12,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ","en":"And [by] the earth which cracks open,","bn":"এবং বিদারনশীল পৃথিবীর","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/12"},{"id":"q:86:13","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":13,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌۭ فَصْلٌۭ","en":"Indeed, the Qur'an is a decisive statement,","bn":"নিশ্চয় কোরআন সত্য-মিথ্যার ফয়সালা।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/13"},{"id":"q:86:14","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":14,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ","en":"And it is not amusement.","bn":"এবং এটা উপহাস নয়।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/14"},{"id":"q:86:15","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":15,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًۭا","en":"Indeed, they are planning a plan,","bn":"তারা ভীষণ চক্রান্ত করে,","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/15"},{"id":"q:86:16","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":16,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًۭا","en":"But I am planning a plan.","bn":"আর আমিও কৌশল করি।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/16"},{"id":"q:86:17","ref":{"kind":"quran","surah":86,"ayah":17,"surahName":"At-Taariq","edition":{"ar":"Uthmani","en":"Saheeh International","bn":"Muhiuddin Khan"}},"ar":"فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا","en":"So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.","bn":"অতএব, কাফেরদেরকে অবকাশ দিন, তাদেরকে অবকাশ দিন, কিছু দিনের জন্যে।","categories":[],"contextUrl":"https://quran.com/86/17"}]}